Name: LiteFace
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Every Face ID prompt uses iOS 18's small Face ID animation at the top of the screen (the one hidden apps use) instead of the box in the middle. iOS 18, Face ID iPhones. No settings.
